# Every text file is kept, and checked out, with plain line feeds on every
# kind of machine. Git on Windows would otherwise end each line with two
# characters, which bash will not run, and which would change what the
# record of whole games sums of the art and the rules it reads.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Pictures and sounds are kept byte for byte.
*.png binary
*.mp3 binary
*.ico binary
